          {"@type":"HowToStep","name":"Start and focus","text":"Start the timer and work exclusively on the chosen task until it rings. If interrupted, note the interruption and decide whether to pause or restart."},
          {"@type":"HowToStep","name":"Short break and reflect","text":"Take a 5-minute break, briefly note progress, and prepare the next micro-goal."},
